A '''Bingo Rift Talisman''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessory]] obtainable on [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profiles.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Bingo Rift Talisman''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Chuckleton}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|name = Bingo Rift Talisman
|rarity = c
|special_effect = While on a [[Bingo|{{Gold|Bingo}}]] profile, you may join the [[Rift|{{Pink|Rift}}]] at {{Green|no cost}}.
}}

== Trivia ==
*The '''Bingo Rift Talisman''' is similar to the {{Item|Rift Prism}}, but at a lower rarity and can only be used on a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile.
*As it is {{Soulbound}}, the '''Bingo Rift Talisman''' cannot be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile to any other profile.

